<title>POLAND: NFI Piast nets PLN 9.5 mln H1.</title>
<headline>NFI Piast nets PLN 9.5 mln H1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) Piast (No. 12) preliminary results for the first half of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					H1 1997</p>
<p>  Net profit			  9.46</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  414.38</p>
<p>  Liabilities and provisions   29.46</p>
<p>  Net assets			391.38</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 12.61</p>
<p>NOTE: The full company name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny Piast SA. The company did not give results for the first half of 1996. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
